@@ -79,2 +79,13 @@ Needs Review marker. Review remains visible in task results. Independent native
-Stash editing, image folder tagging and descriptor custom-field transactions keep
-their existing ownership and semantics.
+Stash editing and descriptor custom-field transactions keep their ownership and
+semantics. Since 0.9.28 the legacy image-folder task can use an existing Tag but
+cannot create native definitions from Franchise folder names. Missing definitions
+are counted as `blockedCreation` in both preview and apply; no misleading
+`wouldUpdate` is reported. The legacy create helper and final GraphQL transport
+both reject automatic `tagCreate`. This does not edit existing image assignments,
+native aliases, registry bindings or the saved creation preference. Definitions
+must be reviewed and created through separately authorized native workflows.
+
+This owner is not a global Stash write interceptor. Native Stash auto-tagging,
+manual editing and other plugins do not pass through its guard. Unsafe native
+aliases remain a separate review concern; removal of an existing scene Tag alone
+does not establish permanent library-wide recurrence prevention.
